From e666856566350657feff43b3a908740ec65354f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juri Wolf <Amerlander@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:14:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Address review: locale-aware blocks cache, reuse
 workspace for TS jobs

- The blocks info cache entry is only used in the locale it was built in.
  The docs renderer can switch the locale (setEditorContextAsync), and the
  apis are localized in place, so a switch rebuilds the entry; before,
  blocks kept the labels of the previous language.
- TypeScript render jobs without options now also reuse the rendering
  workspace, with render()'s default layout (emPixels 18, Align).
---
 pxtrunner/runner.ts | 15 ++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

